# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# A library does not commit pubspec.lock: consumers resolve their own
# versions, and a checked-in lock would only describe this machine.
# https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock
pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
build/

